21
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,430
My Thunder Celestial Grand Formation

22
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,230
shall be

23
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,840
completed today !

24
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,720
The formation isn't complete,

25
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:26,470
but space is already on the verge of collapse.

26
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,480
If this formation is completed,

27
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,630
the Thunder Celestial Realm will become a dead area.

28
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,600
I can't escape.

29
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,070
For now, I'll just have to improvise.

30
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,830
The origin energy of this man

31
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,510
is shaking half of the Celestial Realm fragments.

32
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,670
What's his cultivation level ?

33
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,710
Refining the Celestial Realm into an artifact ?

34
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,310
Not a bad idea.

35
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,110
But without a formation spirit to anchor it,

36
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:14,630
it's nothing but a pile of slightly large rocks.

37
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,110
Celestial Lord,

38
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,830
have a look at that !

39
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,510
Formation spirits...

40
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,840
Appear !

41
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,600
They're all Origin Souls of Illusory Yin cultivators !?

42
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,750
28 souls,

43
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,030
merge !

44
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,790
A mere rank 4 Upper Celestial ?

45
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,750
How embarrassing...

46
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,750
Celestial Lord, wait a moment.

47
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,230
Formation spirits, appear again !

48
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,870
Given his strength,

49
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:17,240
killing over a dozen Corporeal Yang cultivators to take their souls

50
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,230
isn't difficult.

51
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,830
Rank 9 Upper Celestial ?

52
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,350
It's nothing special.

53
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,470
Appear again !

54
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,990
This aura rivals that of the Huan Family Ancestor !

55
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,760
It must be a Nirvana Scryer cultivator !

56
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,710
Rank 3 Sky Celestial ?

57
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,230
It's passable.

58
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,430
This one

59
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,710
is somewhat interesting.

60
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,470
A rank 9 Sky Celestial.

61
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,510
What a pity,

62
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:46,350
he was the fourth person fated with me.

63
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,560
This person's cultivation...

64
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:50,830
I can't see through it.

65
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:53,240
A prodigy of this caliber

66
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,480
is only good enough to be used as a formation spirit ?

67
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,480
What are you roaring about ?

68
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,910
A rank 2 Celestial King...

69
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,440
Fifth soul,

70
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,790
get into position !

71
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,030
Remember your promise.

72
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,590
Blood Ancestor !

73
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,710
Fourth soul,

74
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,870
get into position !

75
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,870
Using a rank 6 Celestial King as a formation spirit

76
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,670
is quite a feat.

77
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,270
Do you have

78
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,950
a Celestial Lord ?

79
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,190
Of course.

80
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,870
This pressure...

81
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,030
I've only felt it from the All-Seer !

82
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,030
Such extraordinary experts

83
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,800
were also soul-extracted and refined into formation spirits !

84
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:19,640
Rank 1 Celestial Lords of the Thunder Celestial Realm !

85
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,990
Third soul, second soul,

86
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,430
get into position !

87
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,910
One last one remains.

88
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,390
Just its killing intent

89
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,790
is enough to shake the world !

90
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:28,200
The rank 6 Slaughter Celestial Lord of the Rain Celestial Realm

91
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,190
has also fallen into your hands.

92
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,350
First soul,

93
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,990
get into position.

94
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,000
Celestial Formation,

95
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,990
activate !

96
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,200
This formation now has world-destroying power...

97
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,210
But why did Master Flamespark

98
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,590
go through the trouble of luring Qing Shui here ?

99
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,150
Nice formation.

100
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:06,400
Although this Celestial Formation is powerful,

101
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:08,390
it still lacks sharpness.

102
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:12,590
I understand now why you're after me.

103
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:15,670
That's correct.

104
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,550
I invited you here

105
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,550
precisely so you can help me

106
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:22,200
to complete the Celestial Formation with your Ji Realm !

107
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,790
May I ask Celestial Lord Qing Shui

108
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,310
what you think of this ?

109
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,830
I told you before

110
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,990
that I'm not Qing Shui !

111
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,430
It seems your memory

112
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:36,670
has been sleeping within the seal for too long...

113
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,310
But today,

114
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,560
I shall use this Celestial Descent Platform

115
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,910
to help you remember !

116
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:45,720
This old man has been to the Celestial Realm hundreds of times

117
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,280
and read countless ancient jades

118
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,670
until I found this one !

119
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,870
What this jade slip records

120
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:55,480
is precisely the life of Celestial Emperor Bai Fan's disciple,

121
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:58,510
Celestial Lord Qing Shui.

122
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,550
Your name is Qing Shui.

123
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:08,110
You were a crown prince in the ancient cultivation world, in the Clear Water State.

124
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,320
When you ascended to the Celestial Realm back then,

125
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,070
you came to this very place,

126
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,310
the Celestial Descent Platform.

127
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,870
And it was also here

128
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,150
that you met Celestial Emperor Bai Fan

129
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,320
and were taken as his disciple.

130
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,030
During the next tens of thousands of years,

131
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,910
you followed Bai Fan in campaigns across the lands

132
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,390
to expand his territory.

133
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,270
You brought honor to your family.

134
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,320
How glorious it was...

135
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,830
But overnight,

136
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,430
Dear ! What's wrong with you ?

137
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,350
You lost your mind

138
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,520
and fell to a demonic possession.

139
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,630
Everyone around you

140
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,870
died by your hand.

141
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:58,310
You possessed the Ji Realm,

142
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,230
so naturally, no one could stand against you.

143
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,200
You slaughtered countless people.

144
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,470
That's how

145
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,430
you brought about the most tragic calamity

146
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:08,510
since the creation of the Thunder Celestial Realm.

147
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,710
Then your master,

148
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:15,510
Celestial Emperor Bai Fan, personally arrived,

149
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:22,320
and helped you regain your senses.

150
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:24,470
But the damage had already been done.

151
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:34,390
Yan'er !

152
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,270
No...

153
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:42,590
No...

154
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,310
Impossible...

155
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,710
Yan'er,

156
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,230
wake up.

157
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:56,710
It's me,

158
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,270
I'm back.

159
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:12,750
Yan'er !

160
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,710
Nooo !!!

161
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:35,750
That day,

162
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:39,230
you split your own body apart in your despair,

163
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,430
and sealed it with artifacts

164
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,630
to condemn yourself to never be reborn.

165
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,030
Bai Fan couldn't bear it,

166
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:49,430
so he placed a healing formation outside the seals

167
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:54,470
in hope that you would awaken one day.

168
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:02,390
If you help me to complete this formation,

169
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:05,790
I will find the cause of your demonic possession.

170
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,710
After that,

171
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,670
you'll be able to avenge your loved ones !

172
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,760
He gathered formation spirits,

173
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,040
raised Thunder Beasts,

174
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,480
and refined the Celestial Realm...

175
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,990
To make Qing Shui help him,

176
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,110
he investigated for tens of thousands of years.

177
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:25,030
This man's behavior seems crazy

178
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:26,950
but in reality, every move he makes

179
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,080
is planned meticulously.

180
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,030
Enough !

181
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,230
Qing Shui,

182
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:40,480
I've helped you recover your memories

183
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,400
out of good will !

184
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,470
What do you mean by this ?

185
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,230
Could he...

186
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,550
have been overtaken by his demonic thoughts once again ?

187
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,280
That shouldn't be possible.

188
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,470
I had finally forgotten...

189
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,510
Why did you...

190
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:00,510
have to remind me ?

191
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,350
Call the Wind !

192
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,680
Celestial Formation, assemble origin !

193
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,270
This is...

194
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,670
the true power of Call the Wind !

195
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:52,590
Celestial Lord Qing Shui,

196
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:53,790
do you know

197
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:55,670
that not long after you were sealed,

198
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,110
your master Bai Fan died under mysterious circumstances

199
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,550
and the Thunder Celestial Realm collapsed soon after ?

200
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:01,870
Don't you want to...

201
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:02,710
Shut up !

202
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:05,790
Summon the Rain !

203
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,070
Ice Seal !

204
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:19,190
After Call the Wind

205
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,590
comes Summon the Rain.

206
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,040
The Celestial Emperor's spells

207
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:24,920
are truly extraordinary.

208
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,150
Qing Shui,

209
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:29,310
Your best choice is to join forces with me.

210
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:31,790
You and I are not enemies.

211
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:35,270
Don't refuse my kind offer only to end up with a worse one !

212
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,910
You need to restore your cultivation

213
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,960
and require a massive amount of origin energy.

214
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:44,110
Come with me to the Alliance Star System

215
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:46,350
and devour strong cultivators there.

216
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,350
With my help,

217
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:50,950
your cultivation will soon return to its peak !

218
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,190
That reason

219
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:55,920
isn't enough !

220
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:07,750
As expected...

221
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:09,880
Just some residual energy

222
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:12,390
is enough to take my life.

223
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:15,160
I found that when you fell into demonic possession back then,

224
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,470
someone in the Rain Celestial Realm also suffered the same fate.

225
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,710
If you help me,

226
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:24,190
I will provide you with the clues and the survivors !

227
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:26,240
Not enough !

228
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:31,670
The Cultivation Alliance has a scroll within its archives

229
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,550
that surfaced shortly after the Celestial Realm collapsed.

230
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:38,670
This item is deeply connected to the destruction of the Celestial Realm !

231
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,030
Your demonic possession,

232
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,510
Bai Fan's death,

233
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,790
and the fall of the Celestial Realm

234
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:48,350
have all been orchestrated by the same thing !

235
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,030
Don't you want to uncover the truth

236
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,950
and avenge your loved one ?

237
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,870
If you lied to me,

238
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:35,190
I will detonate the Ji Realm

239
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,710
and reduce this formation

240
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,790
to dust.

241
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,430
Celestial Lord can rest assured,

242
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:47,950
this old man

243
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:49,640
is not lying !

244
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,070
Celestial Lord, come with me

245
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,910
to meet my friends in the Allheaven Star System.

246
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,120
And then,

247
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:12,640
we will open a passage

248
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:14,110
straight to the Alliance Star System

249
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:16,390
and turn it upside down !

250
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:20,320
Senior, please wait !

251
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,310
Congratulations on completing the formation.

252
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,580
Could you give Junior

253
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,910
his Thunder Beast back ?

254
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,550
I still need your Thunder Beast for a few more days.

255
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:35,550
After I open the passage to the Alliance,

256
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:36,750
I will return it to you.

257
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,750
Little guy,

258
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:41,870
you are fated with me.

259
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:45,190
If you can leave the Thunder Celestial Realm safely,

260
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:48,230
take this token to the Thunder Celestial Temple

261
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:51,390
and I will grant you another fortuitous opportunity.

262
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,990
Since you have learned Call the Wind,

263
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,350
you still count as my master's disciple.

264
00:19:59,000 --> 00:19:59,550
Remember,

265
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:03,070
this spell is one of the 6 great spells he created.

266
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:06,350
Don't let it gather dust in your hands.

267
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:20,010
The Celestial Realm Gate was destroyed.

268
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,070
There is only one way

269
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:22,670
to leave this place.

270
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,360
To enter and exit the Thunder Celestial Realm

271
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:26,560
apart from the Celestial Gate,

272
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:29,200
there are ancient teleportation formations controlled by the Thunder Celestial Temple.

273
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,350
I have

274
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:32,130
placed their location within my Dao Soul

275
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,920
so Master can use them if needed.

276
00:20:42,270 --> 00:23:16,190
The State of Clear Water is an important part of in the lore of the Er Gen universe. For instance, it's heavily referenced in I Shall Seal the Heavens. They added in a lot of details in the scenes of this episode which is a very nice touch !

Clear Water is the literal translation of Qing Shui. For simplicity's sake, we will refer to the character as Qing Shui and his country as Clear Water.

277
00:21:03,230 --> 00:21:08,710
Ask

278
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:06,630
Qi Condensation

279
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:08,790
the perilous path filled with countless blades.

280
00:21:08,270 --> 00:21:09,910
